Diagram ID: D-SQ-01
@startuml
actor Customer
participant "Web Portal UI" as UI
participant "Appointment Controller" as AC
participant "Database" as DB

Customer -> UI: Select Service & Preferred Slot
UI -> AC: Submit Booking Request (Params)
AC -> DB: Query Slot Availability
DB --> AC: Slot Available (True)
AC -> DB: Insert New Booking Record
DB --> AC: Confirm Insertion (Booking ID)
AC --> UI: Render Booking Confirmation Page
UI --> Customer: Display Success Notification
@enduml
